{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Horizon 是一款以 Apple Calendar 為基礎的行事曆整理工具，會把原有行程按工作、健康、家庭與旅遊等類別分類，並透過儀錶板、簡報、小工具、Apple Watch 與 Siri 呈現重要事項。它毋須建立新行事曆或帳戶，適合希望減少行程雜亂、快速掌握每日重心的人。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-146.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>智能分類與快速新增</h2>\n<p>Horizon 以人工智能把行程自動歸入 19 個類別，並從每次修正中學習，亦可自訂類別。Quick Add 支援自然語言輸入，自動填寫日期、時間、地點與重複頻率，新增前可先預覽。今日卡片、每日及每週簡報、Watchlist、免費時段建議與重疊提示，讓用戶快速掌握當天安排；Siri、捷徑及小工具亦可直接查看行程。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-136-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-137-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-138-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-139-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-140-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-141-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Horizon: Calendar Highlights</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/horizon-calendar-highlights/id6761135453?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.203890+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":396,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T04:18:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T21:00:26.329191+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:03.822225+00:00","content_hash":"42b615b4784ea8faba2ce208e2ff19a46d575bbc08e1804fde4c4f0d0af43e55","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.203890+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}